OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fremain cloudy with further outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain, occasionally heavy. Some
OL,8,Fdrier spells expected and the winds
OL,9,Flight or moderate from the southwest.
OL,10,FVery mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,13,Frain, the rain heavy at times. Drier
OL,14,Fand brighter spells developing later
OL,15,Fin the afternoon or evening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,18,Fmixture of bright and sunny spells and
OL,19,Fshowers. Some of the showers will be
OL,20,Fon the heavy side, although mainly dry
OL,21,Fon Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
